      <span class="px-eyebrow">Industries Served · Nuclear &amp; NQA-1</span>
      <h1>Custom thermal equipment. <em>Full QA discipline. No shortcuts.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">For more than 140 years, Harris Thermal has fabricated heat exchangers, ASME pressure vessels, and custom thermal equipment for industry's most demanding applications. Today we support DOE contractors, utilities, SMR developers, and nuclear EPCs that require disciplined fabrication, material traceability, code compliance, and complete documentation packages.</p>
